          "name": "what_is",
          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "## What is OpenCloser?",
          "content": "OpenCloser is an open source AI sales automation platform that runs entirely on your desktop. Built with Tauri and Rust, it provides a complete sales team - lead researcher, voice caller, and sales coach - with all data stored locally in SQLite.",
          "priority": 7
        },
        {
          "name": "features",
          "type": "feature_grid",
          "title": "## ✨ Features",
          "features": [
            {
              "icon": "🎯",
              "title": "AI Strategist",
              "description": "Automatically researches leads and creates personalized outreach strategies based on ICP matching."
            },
            {
              "icon": "🔍",
              "title": "Lead Hunter",
              "description": "AI-powered lead discovery and enrichment. Find decision-makers with contact info automatically."
            },
            {
              "icon": "📞",
              "title": "Voice Caller",
              "description": "Make AI-powered sales calls with natural voice synthesis and real-time objection handling."
            },
            {
              "icon": "📊",
              "title": "War Room",
              "description": "Real-time call monitoring and coaching dashboard for sales managers."
            },
            {
              "icon": "🤖",
              "title": "AI Coach",
              "description": "Get real-time guidance during calls and post-call debriefs with improvement suggestions."
            },
            {
              "icon": "📈",
              "title": "Analytics",
              "description": "Track conversion rates, call outcomes, and team performance - all locally stored."
            }
          ],
          "priority": 8
        },
        {
          "name": "why_opensource",
          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "## 🔒 Privacy First",
          "content": "Unlike cloud-based CRMs, OpenCloser keeps all your data on your machine. Your leads, call recordings, and sales data never leave your computer unless you choose to export them.",
          "priority": 9
        },
